Schemaport has no runtime dependencies and redistributes no third-party code.

The bundled contract dataset under src/schemaport/data/ describes constraints
enforced by third-party services. It contains descriptions and citations
written for this project, not material copied from provider documentation.
Provider and model names appear only to identify the service a record applies
to; no affiliation with or endorsement by any provider is claimed or implied.
